      "data": {
        "text": "**Considering Key Services**\n\nI'm currently focused on selecting a managed key service for the Python script. I'm leaning toward Google Cloud KMS for its integration and features. I need to make sure the provider's unique identifier is clearly visible within the code itself.\n\n\n**Defining Encryption Logic**\n\nI've decided to proceed with implementing encryption using Google Cloud KMS and have a structure for the encrypt_payload.py file. I'm focusing on the `google.cloud.kms_v1` client and the essential function parameters. The next step is to integrate the encryption method to be applied within the function, starting with essential imports and parameters, for clarity and reusability.\n\n\n",
        "time": {
          "end": 1789887487610,
          "start": 1789887485495
        },
